tasks.description:
创建 Note 数据库模型用于存储笔记。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义字段: id (int, 主键), content (str, 笔记内容), created_at (datetime, 创建时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，定义笔记的增删改查 API 路由。实现以下功能：创建笔记 (POST /notes)、获取所有笔记 (GET /notes)、更新笔记 (PUT /notes/{id})、删除笔记 (DELETE /notes/{id})。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，设计一个页面用于显示笔记列表和创建新笔记的表单。页面通过 JavaScript 调用后端 API 实现笔记的增删改查功能。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 static/js/ 目录下创建 notes.js 文件，使用 JavaScript 实现与后端 API 的交互，包括获取笔记列表、创建新笔记、编辑笔记和删除笔记的功能。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

编写测试用例验证笔记功能的正确性。在 tests/ 目录下创建 test_notes.py 文件，测试笔记的创建、读取、更新和删除功能是否正常工作。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
